5BSD import status
==================

See tools/build/fuchsia/README and contrib/README.5BSD for exact scope,
licenses, local changes, native builds, tests, and remaining port work.
Provenance is recorded in UPSTREAM*.json and tools/build/fuchsia/sources.json.

This source import is not an installed capability service. In particular,
the current service IPC has not been replaced and Matter commissioning
and physical Thread radio operation are not validated.
